window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I killed him with my lies, so I could save him with my love.</b></p> <p>There were three things I was certain about.</p> <p>I would never commit murder.</p> <p>I would never strike another bargain.</p> <p>I would never spurn the man I loved to marry the man I loathed.</p> <p>But I murdered, I bargained, and then… I married.</p> <p><i>Get swept away in the dizzying, slow-burn finale, where love coexists with betrayal, and Hunters with Faeries.</i></p>"; 
